# Tailwind CSS Patterns

Usar cn() de @/lib/utils para clases condicionales. Layout: flex/grid, space-y/space-x, p-4. Cards: rounded-lg border bg-card. Texto secundario: text-muted-foreground. Colores del sistema: bg-background, bg-card, bg-primary, text-destructive. Mobile first: md: y lg: breakpoints.
